    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3981" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aspersus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">adsp-</span></b> , Jan), ūs, m.
		aspergo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a sprinkling upon</i> (used only in the
			abl., and perh. only in Plin.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">calidae aquae adspersu,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					8, 37, 56, § 134</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">insecta olei adspersu necantur,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					11, 53, 115, § 279</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aceti adspersu,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					13, 12, 26, § 82 al.</span></i>
			</div>
